# IRONVOW: proof that the game can be finished. The demo player (ivw_bot.c)
# plays from the title with real presses: all seven floors, the Wraith
# Warden, the Comb Matron, the armoury's oathblade, the coin, the wish
# for honour, the Dawnbrand, the three stones, the Pit Regent and the climb
# out. It earns all three goals.
seed 3
game ironvow
botuntil floor >= 1 30000
expect floor == 1
botuntil floor >= 2 60000
expect might >= 8
expect goals & 1
botuntil floor >= 3 80000
expect bosses & 2
expect secrets & 1
botuntil floor >= 4 80000
expect dawn_given == 1
expect secrets == 15
botuntil floor >= 5 80000
expect bosses & 4
botuntil floor >= 6 80000
botuntil escape >= 1 120000
expect dawn_kill == 1
expect bosses & 8
botuntil state == 18 30000
expect goals == 7
expect ending == 1
expect save_wins == 1
expect save_secrets == 4
print save_battles
print save_deaths
print frame
